720">with </span><span begin="02:45.720" end="02:46.110">care</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.110" end="02:50.520"><span begin="02:46.110" end="02:46.320">But </span><span begin="02:46.320" end="02:46.530">my </span><span begin="02:46.530" end="02:46.920">hands </span><span begin="02:46.920" end="02:47.160">are </span><span begin="02:47.160" end="02:47.940">busy </span><span begin="02:47.940" end="02:48.240">in </span><span begin="02:48.240" end="02:48.690">the </span><span begin="02:48.690" end="02:48.990">air</span><span begin="02:48.990" end="02:49.000">, </span><span begin="02:49.000" end="02:49.020">（</span><span begin="02:49.020" end="02:49.950">sing</span><span begin="02:49.950" end="02:50.520">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.520" end="02:56.220"><span begin="02:50.520" end="02:53.610">I </span><span begin="02:53.610" end="02:54.120">wish </span><span begin="02:54.120" end="02:54.390">you </span><span begin="02:54.390" end="02:54.750">were </span><span begin="02:54.750" end="02:56.220">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.250" end="03:00.900"><span begin="02:56.250" end="02:58.980">I </span><span begin="02:58.980" end="02:59.760">wish </span><span begin="02:59.760" end="03:00.000">you </span><span begin="03:00.000" end="03:00.480">were </span><span begin="03:00.480" end="03:00.900">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.800" end="03:07.440"><span begin="03:01.800" end="03:04.950">I </span><span begin="03:04.950" end="03:05.400">wish </span><span begin="03:05.400" end="03:05.670">you </span><span begin="03:05.670" end="03:06.030">were</span><span begin="03:06.030" end="03:06.030">.</span><span begin="03:06.030" end="03:06.030">.</span><span begin="03:06.030" end="03:06.030">.</span><span begin="03:06.030" end="03:06.030">.</span><span begin="03:06.030" end="03:07.440">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.230" end="03:32.730"><span begin="03:16.230" end="03:16.680">Wish </span><span begin="03:16.680" end="03:22.590">